.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH clone 1  "clone " 
.SH NAME
clone \- Duplicate a local snippet under a new name
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBclone\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> <\fINEW\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Duplicate a local snippet under a new name
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Existing name
.TP
<\fINEW\fR>
New name
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg clone ubuntu\-setup laptop\-setup
